22:38.680 --> 22:43.580
<i>We're both the awkward type that'll try to 
brush it off as a joke (so much pressure)</i>

22:43.580 --> 22:47.350
<i>Sigh... Getting this exhausted 
over nothing is so stupid</i>

22:47.350 --> 22:52.090
<i>We'll never move forward or get 
any answers that way, right?</i>

22:52.090 --> 23:00.940
<i>Now you're suddenly grumpy, why all the 
swirling emotions? I sense rain coming</i>

22:52.140 --> 22:54.010
