23:00.940 --> 23:10.150
<i>You can have my umbrella, 
just don't cry or get all mad and soaked</i>

23:10.150 --> 23:14.260
<i>Ah, my broken heart and 
broken body are at odds</i>

23:14.260 --> 23:18.940
<i>I guess I can't deal with this 
unless I put armor on, can I?</i>

23:18.940 --> 23:22.890
<i>Constantly losing and being bewitched, 
all at your mercy, is just frustrating</i>

23:22.890 --> 23:28.520
<i>I'm gonna solve the riddle of 
this impatient, shattering love</i>

23:25.860 --> 23:30.300
<i>(Grinding, throbbing)</i>

23:30.300 --> 23:34.960
<i>Ugh, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:34.960 --> 23:38.940
